    {
      "title": "Terrorist involved in attack on CRPF post killed in Kulgam encounter",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/terrorist-involved-in-attack-on-crpf-post-killed-in-kulgam-encounter-126111601115_1.html",
      "description": "A terrorist was killed while another was trapped in an encounter with security forces in Jammu and Kashmir's Kulgam district where three CRPF personnel were injured in an attack last week, police said on Monday.\n\"Encounter with terrorists started in Kulgam,\" the Kashmir Zone Police said in a post on X.\nThe police said the whole area has been cordoned off with the help of the army and other security forces.\nOfficials identified the trapped terrorists as Lateef Bhatt and Umar. While the body of one terrorist was visible, efforts were on to neutralise the second terrorist.\nThe two terrorists were involved in the attack on a Central Reserve Police Force (CRPF) post in the same district last week.\nAll the nearby units of the army and elite Special Operation Group of the Jammu and Kashmir Police were involved in the encounter.",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-11-16T09:22:08"
    }
  ]
